{
  "$comment": [
    "The novel's own Sequence ladder for the 22 canonical Pathways, in Simplified",
    "Chinese, as published on Qidian. This is a reference table, not app data: it",
    "records what the source fandom already knows each rung is called, so that any",
    "Chinese string Mysterria ships can be checked against it.",
    "",
    "Keys are Mysterria pathway ids. `seq` maps Sequence number -> canonical",
    "Simplified name, and it is the authority: everything else is derived from it.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT - Chinese names a pathway after its SEQUENCE 9, where English names",
    "it after its Sequence 0. English 'Fool pathway' is Chinese 占卜家途径 (Seer",
    "pathway); 愚者 is not the pathway, it is the god at the top of it. The Chinese",
    "LOTM wiki files this route under 占卜家途径, and 百度百科's 愚者 entry is about",
    "the Sequence 0 deity ('序列0代表最高的真神层级，获得相应的神话名号').",
    "",
    "So: seq['9'] is the pathway label, seq['0'] is the deity title. Both ship -",
    "see pathwayNames and deityNames in pathways.zh-CN.json. `canonName` and",
    "`alsoCalled` below are documentation only; nothing reads them.",
    "",
    "Where Mysterria's own English name for a rung does not correspond to the",
    "canonical rung, scripts/check-canon-zh.mjs reports it rather than silently",
    "picking one. Sequence 0 entries are included for completeness even though",
    "Mysterria's data stops at Sequence 1 for most pathways."
  ],
  "source": "https://m.ali213.net/news/gl2508/1687939.html (cross-checked against 百度百科 per-pathway entries)",
